{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11234090","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11234090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1123409001:1":{"text":"여러분, 표정이 왜들 그러시죠?","source_cn":"朋友们，你们看起来脸色不太好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAECFFDAE913ECD35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1123409002:1":{"text":"베어포크들에게 괴롭힘을 당한 하쉬르가 결국 여기를 떠났어요...","source_cn":"有些熊人过来骚扰哈什尔，然后他就离开这里了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1DFA81818C7DAAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1123409003:1":{"text":"그렇군요... 하쉬르가 영지를 떠나다니...","source_cn":"原来如此，他已经离开这片领地了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EE4198A7C5FFA12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1123409003":{"text":"그렇군요... 하쉬르가 영지를 떠나다니...","source_cn":"原来如此，他已经离开这片领地了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EE4198A7C5FFA12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1123409004:1":{"text":"좋아질 기미는 보이지만, 제가 생각한 것과는 아직 거리가 멉니다.","source_cn":"唉，虽然目前部落的改革虽然有所起色，但离我想看到的程度...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D24A9A571991A3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn"